        -:   34://====================================================
        -:   35:// RobotController
        -:   36://====================================================
        -:   37://
        -:   38:// Top-level robotics orchestration engine.
        -:   39://
        -:   40:// RESPONSIBILITIES
        -:   41://
        -:   42://  - Central Runtime Orchestrator
        -:   43://  - Pipeline Coordinator
        -:   44://  - Deterministic Execution Engine
        -:   45://  - System State Management
        -:   46://  - Fault Propagation
        -:   47://  - Emergency Coordination
        -:   48://  - Health Monitoring
        -:   49://  - Runtime Timing Management
        -:   50://  - Future Expansion Point
        -:   51://
        -:   52:// ROBOTICS PIPELINE
        -:   53://
        -:   54://  Read sensors
        -:   55://      ↓
        -:   56://  Filter perception
        -:   57://      ↓
        -:   58://  Interpret environment
        -:   59://      ↓
        -:   60://  Decide navigation
        -:   61://      ↓
        -:   62://  Plan locomotion
        -:   63://      ↓
        -:   64://  Execute motors
        -:   65://      ↓
        -:   66://  Monitor runtime
        -:   67://
        -:   68:// IMPORTANT
        -:   69://
        -:   70://  RobotController MUST:
        -:   71://      - remain deterministic
        -:   72://      - avoid blocking
        -:   73://      - avoid heavy allocations
        -:   74://      - avoid slow IO
        -:   75://
